This way when approaching the menu entry from below using arrow up,
the *last* action in the zoom widget will be focused as expected.

Instead of using focusProxy, adjust focus manually.

---

@felixernst 

`QMenu` is fixed in Qt 6.11 to use `BacktabFocusReason` when navigating upwards: https://code.qt.io/cgit/qt/qtbase.git/commit/?h=6.11&id=69591e6c08cf42d1c31ebbf10c26e65f19913cf7

